  "GPA 3.50+ with ACT 27 or SAT 1260–1290": "GPA 3.50+ при ACT 27 или SAT 1260–1290",
  "GPA 3.50+ with ACT 28 or SAT 1300–1320": "GPA 3.50+ при ACT 28 или SAT 1300–1320",
