  "Academic or Academic Indicator. Nursing, Education and Arts in Fredericton, and Nursing and Health Sciences in Saint John, ask for 7.0.": "Academic или Academic Indicator. Nursing, Education и Arts во Фредериктоне, Nursing и Health Sciences в Сент-Джоне требуют 7.0.",
  "Before 2026: 85. Tests from January 2026 (1–6 scale): 4.5 with at least 4.5 in speaking and writing.": "До 2026: 85. Тесты с января 2026 (шкала 1–6): 4.5, не ниже 4.5 по говорению и письму.",
  "CAEL 60; PTE Academic 59; Cambridge B2 First, C1 or C2 176. Conditional admission with full-time English training at UNB is possible.": "CAEL 60; PTE Academic 59; Cambridge B2 First, C1 или C2 176. Возможен условный приём с очным курсом английского в UNB.",
