  "“Tuition rates published below apply for Fall (September) 2026, Winter (January) 2027 and Summer (May) 2027 intakes.” Some programmes (e.g. Engineering Transfer, Software Engineering) differ.": "«Ставки ниже действуют для наборов осени 2026, зимы 2027 и лета 2027». У некоторых программ (например, Engineering Transfer, Software Engineering) — иначе.",
